  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your destructive powers and undead ambitions feed into each other.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Death sphere, Terrain Casting drawback, non-good alignment.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> For the purpose of determining how many feats of each type you have, you treat your Defiler feats as Necrosis feats and vice versa.</p>\n<p><strong>Four Defiler/Necrosis Feats:</strong> You gain one bonus spell point for every 2 Defiler or Necrosis feats you possess.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/drawback-feats#toc98\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
